# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
#
# Layered on top of ../../firmware_esp32/sdkconfig.defaults (see
# CMakeLists.txt). The first two lines are the slideshow's own
# (apps/slideshow/esp32/sdkconfig.defaults, which explains them); the last is
# what makes this the photo frame.
#
# Defaults only fill symbols an sdkconfig does not already hold: after
# changing this file, delete build/ and sdkconfig, rebuild, and grep the
# symbol back out of sdkconfig rather than assuming it took (CLAUDE.md).

CONFIG_PARTITION_TABLE_CUSTOM_FILENAME="../../firmware_esp32/partitions.csv"
CONFIG_ESP_MAIN_TASK_STACK_SIZE=8192

# A photograph is for looking at: no "n/N name" box over it. The caption is
# drawn unrotated, too, and these photographs are turned for a panel standing
# on its side.
# CONFIG_HAC_SLIDESHOW_CAPTION is not set
